235
00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:23.170
madistavad,
medistavad seal rakendamise puhul on

236
00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:25.900
siin, on nagu näha,
on otse otse nagu seotud popperit,

237
00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:30.020
tal on paha natuke see, et ta on,
