335
00:23:36.230 --> 00:23:38.310
On see ülesanne reaalne?

336
00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:43.869
No olukord on suhteliselt nukker
nende paisutamisega seoses

337
00:23:43.869 --> 00:23:47.170
